# AI Code Explainer - Environment Variables Template
# Step 2B: Google Gemini API Key Configuration
#
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to ".env"
# 2. Get your free API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 3. Replace "your_gemini_api_key_here" with your actual API key.
# 4. Save ".env". It will NOT be committed to Git (listed in .gitignore).

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
